Package: EPIKobo
Title: Routine EPI Supportive Supervision Dashboard (Afghanistan, live from KoboToolbox)
Version: 0.8.0
Description: Downloads the Routine EPI checklist export (EPI_BACKUP) from
    KoboToolbox and shows the Health center, Session and Community
    dashboards that used to live in Power BI, with a combined Home summary,
    and two PowerPoint exports (dashboard deck and the integrated supervision deck).
    Laid out like PAKAFG_Surveillance / AFP_ZeroDose.
Imports: shiny, bslib, DT, plotly, httr2, readr, readxl, dplyr, tidyr, sf,
    ggplot2, ragg, officer, mschart, flextable, writexl, commonmark, zip
License: WHO internal use
